00:21:01.869 --> 00:21:03.869
So.

00:21:03.869 --> 00:21:06.869
Yeah, no, I'm sure you're busy.

00:21:06.869 --> 00:21:11.849
Boy, I gotta tell you that it's a shame.

00:21:11.849 --> 00:21:15.849
You know, it's a 64. Saliers from my private collection.

