I know the girl who was killed.

00:22:41.640 --> 00:22:44.640
Her name was Leslie Willis, aka Livewire.

00:22:44.640 --> 00:22:48.640
You know, I was using the ISIS computers to hack into Tess's mainframe,

00:22:48.640 --> 00:22:51.640
