Tess's assistant is media infected?

00:23:07.259 --> 00:23:09.259
But Tess betrayed her.

00:23:09.259 --> 00:23:10.259
It was all a deception.

00:23:10.259 --> 00:23:11.259
It was all a deception.

00:23:11.259 --> 00:23:16.809
and...

00:23:16.809 --> 00:23:17.809
Chloe!

00:23:17.809 --> 00:23:23.029
What's happening?

00:23:23.029 --> 00:23:24.029
Chloe?

