00:23:57.369 --> 00:23:59.369
Well, she was a shapeshifter, Clark.

00:23:59.369 --> 00:24:01.369
It was her job to fool you.

00:24:01.369 --> 00:24:04.369
She knew that by posing as your best friend,

00:24:04.369 --> 00:24:07.369
