00:24:07.369 --> 00:24:11.190
They've all been tagged.

00:24:11.190 --> 00:24:13.190
As much as I hate what Ava did, she didn't deserve.

00:24:13.190 --> 00:24:18.069
Ava did. She didn't deserve this.

00:24:18.069 --> 00:24:20.069
I know who killed her.

00:24:20.069 --> 00:24:22.069
She told me she and the others are all working for Tess.

00:24:22.069 --> 00:24:26.069
Well, if Mercer has a team looking for a damn stay,

00:24:26.069 --> 00:24:28.069
then Chloe could get caught in the crossfire.

00:24:28.069 --> 00:24:30.069
I'm looking to stand here and wait to find out.

00:24:30.069 --> 00:24:32.069
Test Merson needs to be solved now.

00:24:32.069 --> 00:24:33.069
Clark!

00:24:33.069 --> 00:24:37.069
In my experience with Rots, you never corner one.

00:24:37.069 --> 00:24:40.069
Not when that is lethal.

00:24:40.069 --> 00:24:45.769
She put kill switches in both Ava and the other girl.

00:24:45.769 --> 00:24:47.769
If the rest of her team is wired and you confront

00:24:47.769 --> 00:24:49.769
She could hit a remote and kill them all.

