You said these implants are also GPS devices.

00:24:53.769 --> 00:24:55.769
That means they work on a frequency.

00:24:55.769 --> 00:24:57.769
Do you think you can isolate it?

00:24:57.769 --> 00:25:01.769
I could piggyback on the signal and locate the others.

00:25:01.769 --> 00:25:03.769
Tess's people are hunting doomsday.

00:25:03.769 --> 00:25:07.769
If I can find them, I can find Chloe.

00:25:07.769 --> 00:25:16.569
Eva, I've been searching downtown for hours.

00:25:16.569 --> 00:25:20.569
The Beast is MIA, and so are you.

00:25:20.569 --> 00:25:21.569
I'm starting to lose it.

00:25:21.569 --> 00:25:23.569
I'm starting to lose it.

