00:26:04.420 --> 00:26:07.420
She sent us out to find Chloe and Davis.

00:26:07.420 --> 00:26:10.420
She said we were going to be heroes.

00:26:10.420 --> 00:26:12.420
You still can be.

00:26:12.420 --> 00:26:15.420
But first, we need to make sure that you're safe.

00:26:15.420 --> 00:26:18.420
So tell me where everyone is, and I'll take you to a doctor who can help.

00:26:18.420 --> 00:26:21.420
Then we can find Chloe and Davis together.

00:26:21.420 --> 00:26:23.420
Not until that bitch is dead.

00:26:23.420 --> 00:26:25.420
I know how angry you are.

00:26:25.420 --> 00:26:27.420
You don't have a clue.

00:26:27.420 --> 00:26:28.420
Betas Mercer?

00:26:28.420 --> 00:26:31.420
She's gonna find out how explosive my temper really is.

00:26:31.420 --> 00:26:33.420
I'm gonna turn her over to authorities.

00:26:33.420 --> 00:26:34.420
That's the right thing to do.

00:26:34.420 --> 00:26:37.420
