00:26:37.420 --> 00:26:41.420
Nobody can hurt you because you're some kind of super freak.

00:26:41.420 --> 00:26:46.420
Me? I want real justice and I'm gonna make sure I get it.

00:26:46.420 --> 00:26:48.420
