00:27:10.019 --> 00:27:13.019
There's so much more.

00:27:13.019 --> 00:27:15.019
Don't hurt him.

00:27:15.019 --> 00:27:18.019
There's nothing you can do.

00:27:18.019 --> 00:27:21.019
He's not in control this time.

00:27:21.019 --> 00:27:41.069
East Corridor is secure.

00:27:41.069 --> 00:27:51.099
Sweet dreams.

00:27:51.099 --> 00:28:56.089
Deacon Parasite fell off the grid 20 minutes ago.

00:28:56.089 --> 00:28:58.089
Keep trying themselves.

00:28:58.089 --> 00:29:01.089
And come get me the moment that you make contact.

00:29:01.089 --> 00:29:02.089
Right.

00:29:02.089 --> 00:29:17.210
No, please, don't stop getting addressed on my account.

00:29:17.210 --> 00:29:22.900
You really don't know the meaning of boundaries, do you?

00:29:22.900 --> 00:29:26.900
Well, I know you shot me down earlier, but I'm always eager to try another flyby.

00:29:26.900 --> 00:29:28.900
How did you even get past security?

00:29:28.900 --> 00:29:30.900
I've been sleeping on the job.

00:29:30.900 --> 00:29:36.390
Oliver, I think it's time for you to leave.

00:29:36.390 --> 00:29:40.569
Really? Okay.

00:29:40.569 --> 00:29:52.779
Where the hell are your pants?

00:29:52.779 --> 00:29:54.779
Yeah, yeah, I hid my pants.

00:29:54.779 --> 00:29:57.779
Like that time I hid your clothes in Fiji, in the cabana, remember that?

00:29:57.779 --> 00:29:58.779
That was a good time.

00:29:58.779 --> 00:30:03.119
If I remember correctly, we spent the rest of the vacation on Naturalo.

00:30:03.119 --> 00:30:11.099
natural. You can streak down memory lane all by yourself. Those days are over for me.

00:30:11.099 --> 00:30:17.539
Really? Because I'm pretty sure I felt some of the old chemistry earlier this afternoon.

00:30:17.539 --> 00:30:21.539
Oh, there was tension. Mm-hmm. But it wasn't sexual.

00:30:21.539 --> 00:30:26.539
Well, I'd be like to differ to ask because I've seen that look in your eyes before.

00:30:26.539 --> 00:30:31.539
What do you say, hmm? I'll fly you to places you never knew existed.

00:30:31.539 --> 00:30:36.589
You know, you might want to cool your jets there, ace.

00:30:36.589 --> 00:30:39.539
Maybe we should start over.

00:30:39.539 --> 00:30:41.539
Maybe we should start over.

00:30:41.539 --> 00:30:42.539
It's too late for that now.

00:30:42.539 --> 00:30:56.200
It's the vaults you made me take from Livewire,

00:30:56.200 --> 00:30:58.200
I deep fried your little chips.

00:30:58.200 --> 00:31:02.200
We should have known you're only pretending to be the good mother hen.

00:31:02.200 --> 00:31:07.380
Looks like your freaks have come home to roost.

00:31:07.380 --> 00:31:16.380
Were you able to get through?

00:31:16.380 --> 00:31:18.380
I tried calling the mansion, but all the lines were down.

00:31:18.380 --> 00:31:20.380
Someone's got a warrant, Tess.

00:31:20.380 --> 00:31:22.380
I need to get to Smallville now.

00:31:22.380 --> 00:31:24.380
Are you there yet?

00:31:24.380 --> 00:31:26.380
I'm at the corner of Marshall and Beeman.

00:31:26.380 --> 00:31:28.380
I don't see anything.

00:31:28.380 --> 00:31:29.380
All right, turn north.

00:31:29.380 --> 00:31:31.380
and walk about 30 feet.

00:31:31.380 --> 00:31:36.269
It's not faster than a speeding bullet, but it'll get you there pretty quick.

00:31:36.269 --> 00:32:08.609
Are you in pain?

00:32:08.609 --> 00:32:13.609
Huh? Think how Livewire and Ava felt when you popped their brains.

00:32:13.609 --> 00:32:15.609
They betrayed us all.

00:32:15.609 --> 00:32:18.609
You're the one who betrayed us.

00:32:18.609 --> 00:32:25.119
Just tell me what you want.

00:32:25.119 --> 00:32:30.119
First, you're going to give us access to the inmate files from Black Creek.

00:32:30.119 --> 00:32:34.119
Then we're going to reach out to everyone that suffered your injustice,

00:32:34.119 --> 00:32:35.119
inform our own league.

00:32:35.119 --> 00:32:36.119
League.

00:32:36.119 --> 00:32:40.119
You may have recruited us, but we're free agents now.

00:32:40.119 --> 00:32:46.119
And with all that power, no one will ever mess with us ever again.

00:32:46.119 --> 00:32:49.119
Cough up the password to those files.

00:32:49.119 --> 00:32:54.119
I'm not about to let the world get taken over by a bunch of freaks.

00:32:54.119 --> 00:32:58.119
Well, this freak's gonna make you talk.

00:32:58.119 --> 00:33:04.539
Get away from her.

00:33:04.539 --> 00:33:10.670
Gutsy move coming in with no firepower.

00:33:10.670 --> 00:33:11.670
You better than this bet?

00:33:11.670 --> 00:33:13.670
in this bed. I know you are.

00:33:21.509 --> 00:33:23.509
It's plastic now.

00:33:23.509 --> 00:33:25.509
And no, I'm not.

00:33:25.509 --> 00:33:29.509
Being better means letting people like her get away with murder.

00:33:29.509 --> 00:33:32.509
We'd rather be the bad guys.

00:33:32.509 --> 00:34:17.050
Let him go.

00:34:17.050 --> 00:34:21.360
It's killing me.

00:34:21.360 --> 00:34:24.360
You can stop the pain. Just give me my powers back.

00:34:24.360 --> 00:35:22.070
You'll be happy to know that our misguided teens are locked in a secret rebuild

00:35:22.090 --> 00:35:25.090
facility where escape's not an option.

00:35:25.090 --> 00:35:28.090
Tests won't be able to get her hands on them again.

00:35:28.090 --> 00:35:31.090
So we can focus on finding Chloe and Davis.

00:35:31.090 --> 00:35:34.429
Where's the kryptonite ring?

00:35:34.429 --> 00:35:38.800
It's in a safe place.

00:35:38.800 --> 00:35:41.800
You know some Clark, you're lucky I had that thing. It saved your life.

