You know that ring can kill me. Why would you make something like that?

00:35:46.369 --> 00:35:47.369
I didn't make it.

00:35:47.369 --> 00:35:56.809
I took the ring after I took Lex Luthor's life.

00:35:56.809 --> 00:36:01.849
You're responsible for the explosion.

00:36:01.849 --> 00:36:09.360
You know, Lex may have been your friend a lifetime ago, Clark, but

00:36:09.360 --> 00:36:13.360
Eventually he would have killed you that Meteor Rock ring is proof of that.

00:36:13.360 --> 00:36:15.360
Why were you wearing it?

00:36:15.360 --> 00:36:18.360
In case I don't agree with the next murder you plan?

00:36:18.360 --> 00:36:20.360
You know what? This is great.

00:36:20.360 --> 00:36:22.360
Really, really, really great.

00:36:22.360 --> 00:36:25.360
You don't have the guts to take out that murdering bastard.

00:36:25.360 --> 00:36:28.360
I come in, I mop up your mess, and what do you do?

00:36:28.360 --> 00:36:30.360
You get all self-righteous on me.

00:36:30.360 --> 00:36:32.360
We do what we have to do, Clark!

00:36:32.360 --> 00:36:35.360
Deep down in your heart, you know that that was my only choice

00:36:35.360 --> 00:36:38.360
because you're going to do the exact same thing when you find Davis Bloom.

00:36:38.360 --> 00:36:39.360
And I'm not.

00:36:39.360 --> 00:36:43.360
I can do is hope that the guilt doesn't weigh you down as much as it does me.

00:36:43.360 --> 00:36:45.360
Thank you, Oliver.

00:36:45.360 --> 00:36:47.360
But I'll take it from here.

00:36:47.360 --> 00:36:51.360
All right, look, we don't see eye to eye on everything. That's no secret, Clark.

00:36:51.360 --> 00:36:53.360
We're still on the same side.

00:36:53.360 --> 00:37:04.219
No, we're not.

00:37:04.219 --> 00:37:06.219
I can use that thing to kill him, are you?

00:37:06.219 --> 00:37:09.219
I'm going to use it to split Davis from The Beast

00:37:09.219 --> 00:37:11.219
and send Doomsay to the Phantom Zone alone.

00:37:11.219 --> 00:37:14.219
Well, I guess I wasn't the only one hiding something, then.

00:37:14.219 --> 00:37:16.219
I didn't have a choice, Oliver.

00:37:16.219 --> 00:37:18.219
I had to tell you what you would.

00:37:18.219 --> 00:37:20.219
wanted to hear so you'd get me the black kryptonite.

00:37:20.219 --> 00:37:24.219
How many more lives are you willing to sacrifice if your plan fails this time, Clark?

00:37:24.219 --> 00:37:31.230
Put your ego aside. You have a responsibility.

00:37:31.230 --> 00:37:34.230
My responsibility is to do what's right.

00:37:34.230 --> 00:37:37.230
Like it or not, we stand for something.

00:37:37.230 --> 00:37:42.230
We set an example for others to follow, and if we don't, then we're no better than the people we fight.

00:37:42.230 --> 00:37:50.179
I'm not your enemy, Clark. And who are you?

00:37:50.179 --> 00:38:20.469
You're looking for the crystal?

00:38:20.469 --> 00:38:23.780
Let me guess.

00:38:23.780 --> 00:38:25.780
Eva told you all about it.

00:38:26.780 --> 00:38:30.780
You know, I thought I'd finally figured out the whole Cal-Awl puzzle with the Veritas Journal,

00:38:30.780 --> 00:38:35.780
but sending her an undercover did seem to reveal a few missing cryptonian pieces.

00:38:35.780 --> 00:38:36.780
So what'd you do?

00:38:36.780 --> 00:38:41.780
Have one of your Black Creek inmates steal the crystal before you had them murdered?

00:38:41.780 --> 00:38:44.780
I had nothing to do with their deaths, Clark.

00:38:44.780 --> 00:38:46.780
Black Creek was Lex Luthor's project.

00:38:46.780 --> 00:38:48.780
The chips were implanted there.

00:38:48.780 --> 00:38:50.780
The technology was untested.

00:38:50.780 --> 00:38:53.780
If it malfunctioned, you can't blame me.

00:38:53.780 --> 00:38:55.780
I'm sure there's no way to tie back to you.

00:38:55.780 --> 00:38:56.780
I've already had your people.

00:38:56.780 --> 00:38:58.780
cover your tracks.

00:38:58.780 --> 00:39:00.780
Where is the crystal?

00:39:00.780 --> 00:39:11.280
I had it destroyed, so that you'd have no choice but to kill the beast.

00:39:11.280 --> 00:39:15.280
Sending him to some otherworldly prison, that's not enough.

00:39:15.280 --> 00:39:17.280
How many people like Plastique have you sent to jail,

00:39:17.280 --> 00:39:19.280
only to have them slip through the system?

00:39:19.280 --> 00:39:22.280
What if that happened again?

00:39:22.280 --> 00:39:27.820
You can't tell me that no one's ever escaped from this phantom zone.

00:39:27.820 --> 00:39:29.820
This isn't your battle.

00:39:29.820 --> 00:39:32.820
So you admit that it's yours.

00:39:32.820 --> 00:39:36.670
And Clark, don't you see you see you?

00:39:36.670 --> 00:39:38.670
that I'm doing this all for you.

00:39:38.670 --> 00:39:39.670
For me?

00:39:39.670 --> 00:39:40.670
Yes.

00:39:40.670 --> 00:39:43.670
You're so delusional you put together a small army

00:39:43.670 --> 00:39:46.670
to make some fictional prophecy come true.

00:39:46.670 --> 00:39:48.670
Clark, the mark of a true hero,

00:39:48.670 --> 00:39:52.670
is somebody who's willing to sacrifice his own personal morality

00:39:52.670 --> 00:39:54.670
to help keep the world safe.

00:39:54.670 --> 00:39:59.369
No one has the right to choose who lives and dies.

00:39:59.369 --> 00:40:01.369
I was beginning to think that you were different from Lex.

00:40:01.369 --> 00:40:08.300
I was wrong.

00:40:08.300 --> 00:40:12.300
The difference is that he turned his back on you.

00:40:12.300 --> 00:40:16.079
But I still believe.

00:40:16.079 --> 00:40:18.079
I don't believe.

00:40:18.079 --> 00:40:22.420
I understand that if everyone was more like you,

00:40:22.420 --> 00:40:26.059
the world would be a better place.

00:40:26.059 --> 00:40:28.059
But the truth is that that's out of your hands now.

00:40:28.059 --> 00:40:33.900
You can't avoid your fate.

00:40:33.900 --> 00:40:35.900
Lex did teach me one thing.

00:40:35.900 --> 00:40:45.280
The word fate is used by people who've lost sight of who they are.

00:40:45.280 --> 00:40:50.869
Why are you so determined to see Davis Bloom die?

00:40:50.869 --> 00:40:52.869
That's simple, Clark.

00:40:52.869 --> 00:40:55.869
An entire civilization's survival depends on it.

00:40:55.869 --> 00:41:38.300
It's counter ready to fulfill the prophecy.

00:41:38.300 --> 00:41:40.300
I did as you asked.

00:41:40.300 --> 00:41:43.639
The crystal has been destroyed.

